{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：22:45 2026-11-04 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"美股開市｜三大指數齊升 道指飆升1000點 \" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/38bd6a9f5ad894e3bf217fd62d47ba82/2026-11/stock_photo_4_1200x676_1.jpg\"/>\n<p>美國中期選舉結束，民主黨大勝，將會掌控參眾兩院。三大指數全線上升，道指開盤飆升過千點，升幅約2%；標普500指數升幅1.4%；納指升幅1.6%。微軟（MSFT）升5.7%、亞馬遜（AMZN）升7%、蘋果（AAPL）升5.6%。</p>\n<p>傳統股升勢亦普遍，波音（BA）升3%、摩根大通（JPM）升2.7%、富國銀行（WFC）升2%、迪士尼（DIS）升3.3%、星巴克（SBUX）升2%、麥當勞公布業績後升4%。</p>\n<p>出錢出力助共和黨選情的首富馬斯克是大輸家，旗下兩間公司SpaceX（SPCX）及Tesla（TSLA），開市分別跌3.5%及4.8%。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T15:05:40.263042+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":294,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T14:45:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T16:58:43.589833+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T14:58:39.121202+00:00","content_hash":"ed4a1791dbebd2c72fbe9d428aa636db194becb2345cdfcfbf04ca8eed7cd0bd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}